Canonical website:
  https://github.com/gerbv/gerbv

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/gerbv/gerbv/archive/refs/tags/v2.13.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack gerbv-2.13.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./gerbv-2.13.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/gerbv-2.13.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/gerbv-2.13.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgerbv1-2.13.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgerbv-devel-2.13.0-X.tar.xz

